[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3841.75, "timestamp": "01:04:01", "text": "根深いものだと気づいた。 これにはたくさんの要素が詰まっている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3843.99, "timestamp": "01:04:03", "text": "。 例えば、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3844.356, "timestamp": "01:04:04", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "dear golden child, evil people dont have a reason to be evil"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3850.39, "timestamp": "01:04:10", "text": "理由も分からずに非常に大きな才能を持つクリエイティブな友人がいる場合、あなたは何かで"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3852.398, "timestamp": "01:04:12", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "same goes for jealous ppl"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3862.39, "timestamp": "01:04:22", "text": "良い思い出のある友情が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3864.029, "timestamp": "01:04:24", "text": "ライバル関係"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3868.549, "timestamp": "01:04:28", "text": "や競争関係に変わり、最終的には"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3872.99, "timestamp": "01:04:32", "text": "有害な友情になってしまうでしょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3879.91, "timestamp": "01:04:39", "text": "良くないことです。 いやあ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3881.15, "timestamp": "01:04:41", "text": "人間って本当に色々なことがあるよね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3885.549, "timestamp": "01:04:45", "text": "。 人間の感情や表情、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3889.109, "timestamp": "01:04:49", "text": "すべて。 これについては語るべきことがたくさんある。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3898.309, "timestamp": "01:04:58", "text": "私は嫉妬とかそういうことについて、身をもって痛感したし、"}]